 referred to as a \"unigram\"; size 2 is a \"bigram\" (or, less commonly, a \"digram\"); size 3 is a \"trigram\". Larger sizes are sometimes referred to by the value of n, e.g., \"four-gram\", \"five-gram\", and so on.","topics":[],"score":229826,"global_rank":112942},{"name":"kpwhri/apanc-runrex","owner":"kpwhri","html_url":"https://github.com/kpwhri/apanc-runrex","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Feature extraction for developing an algorithm to identify acute pancreatitis cases.","topics":[],"score":229820,"global_rank":112958},{"name":"lsterzinger/atm115","owner":"lsterzinger","html_url":"https://github.com/lsterzinger/atm115","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229809,"global_rank":112968},{"name":"alexandsquirrel/Neural-Networks-and-Formal-Languages","owner":"alexandsquirrel","html_url":"https://github.com/alexandsquirrel/Neural-Networks-and-Formal-Languages","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Probing how neural networks learn to recognize formal languages.","topics":[],"score":229796,"global_rank":112981},{"name":"nissim-panchpor/PageRank-algorithm-using-Eigonfactor-values","owner":"nissim-panchpor","html_url":"https://github.com/nissim-panchpor/PageRank-algorithm-using-Eigonfactor-values","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":["eigonfactor-values","graph","pagerank-algorithm","python","social-network"],"score":229794,"global_rank":112984},{"name":"Faezov/paper-editor","owner":"Faezov","html_url":"https://github.com/Faezov/paper-editor","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"paper-editor","topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":112992},{"name":"justincastilla/kibana-flight-tracker","owner":"justincastilla","html_url":"https://github.com/justincastilla/kibana-flight-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issue